data: {"id": "414bfe4d3c344a6f-thinking-parallel_evidence-924", "run_id": "414bfe4d3c344a6f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Node2 状态为 **Ready**，排除节点 NotReady/Unknown 导致的 TerminatingStuck。\n\n## 已采集事实总结\n\n### 支持 TerminatingStuck 的证据\n1. **Pod YAML 确认对象仍然存在**：`kubectl get pod workload -n aiops-case-11 -o yaml` 返回了完整对象，`deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-11T03:47:07Z` 存在，说明删除请求已发出但对象未被清理。\n2. **存在自定义 finalizer**：`metadata.finalizers: [\"aiops.lab/hold\"]` — 这是最关键的阻塞原因。该 finalizer 由自定义控制器/准入逻辑持有，在 finalizer 被移除之前，kube-apiserver 不会真正删除 Pod 对象。\n3. **Terminating 持续时间极长**：describe 显示 \"Terminating (lasts 41m)\"，从 03:47:07 至今已 41 分钟仍未被删除。\n4. ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789100945855, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

