data: {"id": "414bfe4d3c344a6f-final", "run_id": "414bfe4d3c344a6f", "seq": 929, "ts_ms": 1789100965840, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-11/workload` | Terminating | Pod workload 因 metadata.finalizers 中存在 'aiops.lab/hold' 自定义 finalizer 而处于 Terminating 状态。虽然容器已在 41 分钟前因 SIGKILL (exitCode 137) 终止且节点 Ready，但 API Server 必须等待该 finalizer 的持有者释放资源后才会执行对象删除操作。该 finalizer 持有者（推测为自定义控制器）未能完成清理或响应删除请求，导致 Pod 卡死。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.status | Terminating (lasts 41m) | 确认当前 Pod 处于卡死状态，且持续时间较长 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | event.message | Stopping container app (41m ago), Exit Code: 137 | 表明容器早在 41 分钟前已因 SIGKILL 终止，但状态未清除 |\n| 3 | K8s State | pod.condition | Ready=False, ContainersReady=False, reason=\"ContainersNotReady\" (16m ago) | 证明容器已停止运行，节点状态与 Pod 元数据状态存在冲突 |\n| 4 | K8s State | pod.phase | Running | 反映 API Server 的 etcd 中仍将该 Pod 对象维持在工作负载中 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | event.message | Killing | 确认 kubelet 已经执行了删除容器的动作 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | container.resource_limit.memory | 96Mi (limit), 24Mi (request) | 排除明显内存超限的常规 OOMKilled 场景，提示 Exit 137 可能由外部信号触发 |\n| 7 | Metric | kube_pod_status_phase | Running=1 (at 04:28:48) | 侧面印证 API Server 视角的对象状态未被更新或清理 |\n| 8 | Metric | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total | 0 (at 04:28:48) | 证明该 Pod 启动后没有发生过自动重启，符合 Terminating 阶段特征 |\n\n上述证据表明，虽然底层容器（由 kubelet 管理）已因异常被清理（Exit 137），但控制平面的 Pod 对象并未完成删除流程。`phase: Running` 与 `exit_code: 137` 的同时存在，以及长达 41 分钟的 `Terminating` 滞留，是典型的资源未正确释放导致的死锁现象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nmetadata.finalizers 存在自定义 finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold' → Kubernetes API Server 阻止 Pod 对象从 etcd 物理删除 → Pod 对象卡在 Terminating 状态且 phase 显示 Running → 用户可见 Pod 无法删除且状态异常\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为自定义 Finalizer `'aiops.lab/hold'` 的持有者（通常为特定的 Operator 或 Controller）未能响应或完成删除清理逻辑。\n\n1. **直接机制**：Kubernetes 在删除 Pod 时，如果发现 `metadata.finalizers` 中包含未被移除的条目，API Server 会阻止该对象从 etcd 中删除。\n2. **现象印证**：\n    - 容器早在 41 分钟前已被 kubelet 杀掉（`Exit Code: 137`）[证据 #2, #5]。\n    - 但 Pod 元数据状态仍显示为 `Terminating` 且 `phase: Running` [证据 #1, #4]。\n    - 资源已释放但对象未移除，符合 Finalizer 未清理导致的典型特征。\n\n目前证据不足以确认 `'aiops.lab/hold'` 的具体持有组件状态（Logging/Tracing 缺失），但基于 K8s 状态事实，最终根因指向该自定义 Finalizer 持有者未能完成清理。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 36.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 36.1s (Evidence 27.4s, RCA 8.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.245, "metrics": {"run_id": "414bfe4d3c344a6f", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.25145530700684, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 64251.455307006836, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 61343.557596206665, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5922.4653244018555, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2549.948215484619}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16907.306909561157, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 36083.22715759277, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11237.804889678955, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

